error[E0111]: `#{` starts a splice outside a `quote`
 --> tests/ui/splice_glued_outside_quote_uses.wid:6:34
  |
6 |   def f -> proc(n: Int) -> Int = @on_#{event}
  |                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^ a splice only works inside `quote do … end`
  = note: inside one, a splice can't be part of a name either: it inserts a whole name
help: build the name as a `Symbol` in the macro, before the `quote`, and splice it whole: `on_event = "on_#{event}".to_sym`, then `#{on_event}`
  = see `wid explain E0111`

